  (text "What this does: Lets the board start before firmware is running, then hands the appropriate power controls to the flight MCU.\nConnects to: Battery/USB status -> comms power enable; 4V_PRE level -> core input enable. Feeds the held flight path, comms limiter and the inter-MCU status link."
    (at 15.24 27.94 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "c55a094d-1742-513c-8009-37b02a1e8f55")))
